# Everything the image does not need, and some things it must never contain.
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/storybook-static
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
apps/api/.contract
apps/web/src/locales/*.mjs

# State and history. .claude carries the board and roast session ids, .git the
# whole history: neither belongs in a published container image.
.claude
.git
.github
**/*.md
